	"FriendlyName": "Claude Test Helper",
	"Description": "Commands for automated game tests driven by Claude Code (the unreal-toolkit Claude plugin): the Test.Scenario runner, real input (Input.Press, Input.Wheel, Input.Stick, Input.Keys, Input.Held, Input.Rebind), Anim.Freeze for pixel-stable screenshots, and Reader.Read to print a subsystem's state as JSON. Nothing of it is in shipping builds.",
